{
 "_report": "Pyros, rebuilt on the V3 world kit (Map Logic Pack). Arrive at the Pyros Spaceport (west) and walk east through Cinder Hollow Lane Homes into Cinder Hollow (kept V2 town core; its left edge opened at x=0 rows 6-9 to meet Lane Homes; Recovery Bay and shop swapped to the kit rooms under their old ids 083/084; Old Basalt's M11/S70 spots stay). Basalt Crossroads east of town is the hub: north to the Quiet Court (houses incl. Old Basalt's Quarters and the Smelter Room) and the hidden Ember Hollow Grove (chest); south down the Lava Lake Shore (lava edge, S71 giver) and Ashfall Flats to the Farmstead and the Magma Pit Arena (exterior -> lobby -> battle room); east to Lava Fork. Lava Fork: east to the Volcano Relay Tower (Trial Floor 091 -> Keeper Room 092 with Old Basalt); north up Cinder Slope, Magma Flow Bend and Mine Shaft Hollows to the Deep Mines (entrance + B1/B2/Depths reusing old ids 087-089 so S70/S72/M11 spots and miner trainers stay; chest in the Depths); south to Mine Junction -> Helix front (Abandoned Smelter -> Helix Secret Lab) and Furnace Ridge Overlook (dead end, chest).",
